Note on the educational content

The crop and farming information published by this project is general guidance
for learning. Agricultural practices depend on local soil, climate, varieties and
market conditions. Nothing on the site is professional agronomic advice, and the
authors accept no liability for decisions taken on the basis of it. Always confirm
field decisions with your local agriculture department or Krishi Vigyan Kendra.
